      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There were some present at that very time who told him of the Galileans whose blood Pilate had mingled with their sacrifices. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.9.1+JHN.9.2+JHN.9.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 9.1-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And he answered them, “Do you think that these Galileans were worse sinners than all the other Galileans, because they suffered thus? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I tell you, No; but unless you repent you will all likewise perish. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Or those eighteen upon whom the tower in Siloam fell and killed them, do you think that they were worse offenders than all the others who dwelt in Jerusalem? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I tell you, No; but unless you repent you will all likewise perish.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
