          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.13.31+MAT.13.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 13.31-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.4.30+MRK.4.31+MRK.4.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 4.30-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " He said therefore, “What is the kingdom of God like? And to what shall I compare it? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is like a grain of mustard seed which a man took and sowed in his garden; and it grew and became a tree, and the birds of the air made nests in its branches.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
